  "discussion": {
    "headline": "relatively warm into next week with storms on thursday",
    "dateLine": "1:00 p.m. Tuesday, September 8, 2026",
    "excerpt": "As expected, the weather over Labor Day Weekend was nothing short of spectacular across northern MD and southeastern PA. From Saturday-Monday, high temperatures topped out in the upper 70s to low 80s with overnight lows in the comfortable mid 50s to low 60s. Better yet, skies were partly-to-mostly sunny and humidity low with dewpoints generally in the 50s. You really couldn't have asked for a better \"unofficial\" end to summer! …",
